-
-| ID | Owns (one decision) | Target status |
-|---|---|---|
-| 0001 | Host truth, readiness, runtime selection | `Implemented` (unchanged) |
-| 0002 | One interaction loop, turn/session ownership | `Implemented` (refs corrected) |
